# Предложения
## Получить список предложений
GET http://localhost:4000/offers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

## Получить предложение
GET http://localhost:4000/offers/6aff53686eebdbbc3646ebc3 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
###

## Получить премиум-предложения в Париже
GET http://localhost:4000/offers/premium/Paris HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
###

## Удалить предложение
DELETE http://localhost:4000/offers/6aff53686eebdbbc3646ebc3 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
###

## Добавить новое предложение
POST http://localhost:4000/offers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Уютный домик на краю океана",
  "description": "Просторный и спокойный рядом с Атлантическим океаном.",
  "date": "2026-07-15T12:00:00.000Z",
  "city": "Paris",
  "previewUrl": "https://example.com/paris-preview.jpg",
  "imagesUrl": ["https://example.com/paris-1.jpg", "https://example.com/paris-2.jpg",
    "https://example.com/paris-3.jpg", "https://example.com/paris-4.jpg", "https://example.com/paris-5.jpg",
    "https://example.com/paris-6.jpg"],
  "isPremium": true,
  "housingType": "apartment",
  "roomCount": 2,
  "maxAdults": 3,
  "price": 1850,
  "goods": ["Breakfast", "Air conditioning"],
  "author": "6adf07b2a0f0327a24259666",
  "location": { "latitude": 48.85661, "longitude": 2.351499 }
}

###

## Добавить новое предложение от пользователя
POST http://localhost:4000/offers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Уютный домик с видом на Альпы",
  "description": "Просторный и спокойный коттедж с камином и видом на горы.",
  "date": "2024-07-15T12:00:00.000Z",
  "city": "Cologne",
  "previewUrl": "https://example.com/paris-preview.jpg",
  "imagesUrl": ["https://example.com/paris-1.jpg", "https://example.com/paris-2.jpg",
    "https://example.com/paris-3.jpg", "https://example.com/paris-4.jpg", "https://example.com/paris-5.jpg",
    "https://example.com/paris-6.jpg"],
  "isPremium": true,
  "housingType": "apartment",
  "roomCount": 3,
  "maxAdults": 4,
  "price": 2000,
  "goods": ["Breakfast", "Air conditioning"],
  "author": "6b01cb834074ec45f2f32f67",
  "location": { "latitude": 50.938361, "longitude": 6.959974 }
}

###

## Изменить предложение
PUT http://localhost:4000/offers/6aff53686eebdbbc3646ebc3 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Обновлённый домик с видом на Альпы",
  "description": "Просторный и спокойный коттедж с камином и видом на горы.",
  "city": "Cologne",
  "previewUrl": "https://example.com/cologne-preview.jpg",
  "imagesUrl": [
    "https://example.com/cologne-1.jpg",
    "https://example.com/cologne-2.jpg",
    "https://example.com/cologne-3.jpg",
    "https://example.com/cologne-4.jpg",
    "https://example.com/cologne-5.jpg",
    "https://example.com/cologne-6.jpg"
  ],
  "isPremium": true,
  "housingType": "house",
  "roomCount": 4,
  "maxAdults": 6,
  "price": 2500,
  "goods": ["Breakfast", "Air conditioning", "Fridge"],
  "location": {
    "latitude": 50.938361,
    "longitude": 6.959974
  }
}
###
